# stage 1 (H-A): commit latency vs offered load and constant fsync delay. enforce=1 (100 ms rpc timeout).
# load levels fixed after stage 0: 500 (low), 2000 (near the knee), 3000 (past it).
# leader-delay cells use utilisation rho = rate * (delay + ~0.3 ms fsync): d=10ms -> 24/48/87 writes/s (rho ~0.25/0.5/0.9)
none_500    500   1 -        -
none_2000   2000  1 -        -
none_3000   3000  1 -        -
F1d40_500   500   1 F1=40ms  -
F1d40_2000  2000  1 F1=40ms  -
F1d40_3000  3000  1 F1=40ms  -
Ld10_24     24    1 L=10ms   -
Ld10_48     48    1 L=10ms   -
Ld10_87     87    1 L=10ms   -
